This file contains instructions for installing the libcstor library:

Steps for compiling libcstor library
------------------------------------

# ./autogen.sh
# ./configure --libdir=/usr/lib64
# make && make install

Note: to enable debug logs libcstor can be compiled in debug
mode using the '--enable-debug' option of configure script as shown:

# ./autogen.sh
# ./configure --libdir=/usr/lib64 --enable-debug
# make && make install
